-- Eight buying intent guides: cheap concert tickets, all-in pricing ("no fees"), ticket refunds, face value, ticket insurance, dynamic pricing, and the October and November concert planners.
-- Each post is 1,800 words or more with internal links, official external sources (FTC and TicketNetwork policies), FAQ data and a live listings block. Idempotent: re-running updates the same slugs.

